"06. Copy Transaction ID from payment confirmation message and paste that Transaction ID below"
msgstr ""

#: includes/functions.php:19
msgid ""
"01. Go to your Rocket app or Dial *322#\n"
"02. Choose \"Send Money\"\n"
"03. Enter below Rocket Account Number\n"
"04. Enter <b>total amount</b>\n"
"05. Now enter your Rocket Account PIN to confirm the transaction\n"
"06. Copy Transaction ID from payment confirmation message and paste that Transaction ID below"
msgstr ""

#: includes/functions.php:28
msgid ""
"01. Go to your Nagad app or Dial *167#\n"
"02. Choose \"Send Money\"\n"
"03. Enter below Nagad Account Number\n"
"04. Enter <b>total amount</b>\n"
"05. Now enter your Nagad Account PIN to confirm the transaction\n"
"06. Copy Transaction ID from payment confirmation message and paste that Transaction ID below"
msgstr ""

#: includes/functions.php:37
msgid ""
"01. Go to your Upay app or Dial *268#\n"
"02. Choose \"Send Money\"\n"
